      "short": "Four adults and two infants in a warmly lit interior; central woman in red holds a baby, a man observes another infant beside a lamb, and an older woman sits with a basket.",
      "long": "A painted group scene featuring four adults and two infants. A central woman in a vivid red gown with blue sleeves cradles a nude infant; they are in close proximity, foreheads nearly touching. To her left, a bearded man in grey drapery watches a second nude infant standing barefoot on a wooden platform, next to a small white lamb. The infant wears a fringed white loincloth and reaches toward the lamb. On the far right, an older woman with a white head covering and dark clothing sits with hands resting on a green cloth beside a wicker basket holding folded white and striped linens. The lighting is dramatic, highlighting skin tones and fabric textures against a dark, undefined background.",
